{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24044","headline":"山游示小妓 · 白居易","name":"山游示小妓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"双鬟垂未合，三十才过半。\n本是绮罗人，今爲山水伴。\n春泉共挥弄，好树同攀翫。\n笑容花底迷，酒思风前乱。\n红凝舞袖急，黛惨歌声缓。\n莫唱杨柳枝，无肠与君断。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24044.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24044","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}